graph TD
    START([Start]) --> generate_question[generate_question<br/>QuestionNode<br/>Sets difficulty & time limit]
    generate_question --> evaluate_answer[evaluate_answer<br/>EvaluationNode<br/>Multi-dimensional scoring<br/>Time tracking]
    evaluate_answer --> route{route_after_evaluation}
    route -->|score < 3 OR follow_up hint<br/>ask_follow_up| ask_follow_up[ask_follow_up<br/>FollowUpQuestionNode<br/>Shorter time limit]
    route -->|asked < question_limit<br/>ask_next| generate_question
    route -->|asked >= question_limit<br/>finish| generate_feedback[generate_feedback<br/>FeedbackNode]
    ask_follow_up --> evaluate_answer
    generate_feedback --> END([End])
    
    style START fill:#90EE90
    style END fill:#FFB6C1
    style generate_question fill:#87CEEB
    style evaluate_answer fill:#DDA0DD
    style ask_follow_up fill:#FFB347
    style generate_feedback fill:#F0E68C
    style route fill:#FFA500
